<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Foot Step Android — Privacy</title><style>body{font:16px/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif;background:#faf9f5;color:#24392f;margin:0}main{max-width:720px;padding:40px 24px;margin:auto}a{color:#a73f1f}h1,h2{line-height:1.25}</style></head><body><main><h1>Foot Step Android app privacy</h1><p>Effective 10 November 2026. This notice describes the native Foot Step Android app connected to footsteponline.com.</p><h2>Information used by the app</h2><p>To sign in or register, the app sends your account identity and password to Foot Step over HTTPS. For delivery, you supply your name, phone, address and delivery area. The store keeps your account, purchases and order status. Normal server security logs may include your IP address and request metadata.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Foot Step uses this information to authenticate accounts, enforce customer/admin permissions, calculate prices, process orders, arrange delivery and provide support. Delivery details can be shared with the store's delivery provider when an order is booked for shipping. Administrator functions are available only to authorized store accounts.</p><h2>On your device</h2><p>The sign-in token is encrypted with Android Keystore and expires after 14 days or when revoked. Selected cart items are saved locally. Signing out clears the local account session and cart. Android backup and device transfer of app data are disabled. The app requests internet access; it does not request contacts, location, SMS or broad photo/storage permissions.</p><h2>Tracking and payments</h2><p>This native app includes no advertising, analytics or social tracking SDKs. Orders currently use cash on delivery; the app does not collect card or bank details. Store operations and delivery integrations run on Foot Step's backend.</p><h2>Deletion and retention</h2><p>You can delete your customer account through Accounts → Delete account, after verifying your password. Your account, saved addresses, cart, wishlist, reviews and sign-in sessions are deleted. Contact and shipping details on completed/cancelled orders are anonymized; non-identifying order numbers, product lines, totals and status remain as business records. Resolve active delivery/refund orders before deletion; support can help. Native app users do not upload photos or files.</p><p><a href="https://footsteponline.com/api/mobile/v1/account-deletion">Delete your account or request deletion without the app</a></p><h2>Contact Foot Step</h2>@if($email)<p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ $email }}">{{ $email }}</a></p>@endif @if($phone)<p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{ $phone }}">{{ $phone }}</a></p>@endif</main></body></html>
